# Physical Topology

This document covers hardware placement and port use. The port inventory in `data/network/ports.yaml` is the authoritative version.

## Placement

- Garage rack: Flint 2, CRS310, server infrastructure, garage YuanLey switch.
- Office: Beryl AX, GL-S200, office YuanLey switch.

## Logical Topology

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    internet["Internet / ISP"]
    flint["mgmt-router-01<br>Flint 2"]
    crs["mgmt-switch-01<br>CRS310"]
    beryl["mgmt-ap-01<br>Beryl AX"]
    s200["mgmt-thread-01<br>GL-S200"]
    garage["garage-switch-01<br>YuanLey 9-port"]
    office["office-switch-01<br>YuanLey 6-port"]
    nas["server-nas-01"]
    desktop["lan-desktop-01"]

    internet --> flint
    flint -->|trunk| crs
    crs -->|trunk| beryl
    crs -->|hybrid: 99 untagged, 30 tagged| s200
    crs -->|access vlan 10| garage
    crs -->|access vlan 20| office
    crs -->|access vlan 10| nas
    crs -->|access vlan 20| desktop
```

